@baseUrl = https://localhost:7098
@token = pegar-aqui-el-accessToken

### Alta de comercio (onboarding)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/registro
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombreComercio": "Almacén Demo",
  "slug": "almacen-demo",
  "cuit": null,
  "nombreAdministrador": "Administrador Demo",
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "cambiar-esta-clave-123"
}

### Login (devuelve JWT con uid, tid y role)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "comercio": "almacen-demo",
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "cambiar-esta-clave-123"
}

### Categorías del comercio
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/categorias
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Productos del comercio (filtrados por TenantId)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/productos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear producto (solo Administrador)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/productos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "7790001",
  "nombre": "Yerba 1kg",
  "precioCompra": 1000,
  "moneda": "ARS",
  "porcentajeGanancia": 30,
  "porcentajeIva": 21,
  "categoriaId": "pegar-id-de-categoria",
  "venderSinStock": false
}
